@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

title Spring Batch Error Handling and Fault Tolerance

participant "Spring Batch Job" as Job
participant "ItemProcessor" as Processor
participant "ItemWriter" as Writer
participant "Database" as DB

note over Job: **Processing Chunk 1 (10 items)**

group Items 1-7: Success
    loop 7 times
        Job -> Processor: process(item)
        Processor --> Job: ProcessedFeed
    end
end

note over Job,Processor #FFAAAA: **Item 8: API Error**
Job -> Processor: process(item8)
Processor -> Processor: Transit.land API timeout
Processor -->x Job: Exception

note over Job #FFFFAA
  Skip item 8
  skipCount++
  Continue processing
end note

group Items 9-10: Success
    loop 2 times
        Job -> Processor: process(item)
        Processor --> Job: ProcessedFeed
    end
end

note over Job: **Write Phase (9 items)**
Job -> Writer: write(chunk)
Writer -> DB: Save batch
DB --> Writer: Success

note over Job #AAFFAA
  ✅ **Commit Chunk 1**
  (9 items saved, 1 skipped)
end note

== Chunk 2 Processing ==

note over Job: **Processing Chunk 2**
Job -> Processor: process(items...)
Processor -->x Job: Database connection error

note over Job #FFAAAA
  ❌ **Rollback Chunk 2**
  No items committed
end note

note over Job #FFCCCC
  **Job Status: FAILED**
  Can restart from chunk 2
  Previous chunks remain committed
end note

== Job Restart ==

note over Job #CCFFCC
  **Restart Job**
  Resumes from chunk 2
  Skips already processed chunks
end note

Job -> Processor: process(chunk 2 items)
Processor --> Job: ProcessedFeed
Job -> Writer: write(chunk 2)
Writer -> DB: Save batch
DB --> Writer: Success

note over Job #AAFFAA
  ✅ **Job Completed**
  All chunks committed
end note

@enduml
